From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Ricardo Salveti <ricardo.salveti@oss.qualcomm.com>
Date: Fri, 9 Oct 2026 10:50:51 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] ucm2: Arduino Monza: fix headset microphone capture

Capture from the Headset device on the Arduino VENTUNO Q returns only
silence: its enable sequence aborts before the ADC mixers are set up,
because the card has no 'Headset Mic Switch' control:

  unable to execute cset 'name='Headset Mic Switch' on'

The qcs8275 sound card only has per-input pin switches for this codec,
such as 'Headset Mic12' and 'Headset Mic56'.

Dropping that line alone is not enough, as the device feeds the ADC
mixers from MIC2, which the shared max98090 enable sequence routes to
IN3/IN4 ('MIC2 Mux' IN34). On the VENTUNO Q those pins are not
connected. The headset jack of the UNO Media Carrier goes to IN1/IN2
of the MAX98091 (MIC_IN1_IN2 to JMISC_AUDIO_MIC_IN in the ABX00181
schematics), which the device already selects with 'MIC1 Mux' IN12 and
the 'Headset Mic12' pin, matching the IN12 and MICBIAS routes of the
device tree. With MIC1 left out of every enabled path, DAPM also keeps
MICBIAS off, so the headset microphone is not biased either.

Drop the non-existent switch and feed the ADC mixers from MIC1.

Tested on the VENTUNO Q with the UNO Media Carrier and a CTIA headset:
the Headset device enables without errors, MICBIAS is on, and speech
recorded from it plays back clearly on the Headphones device.

Assisted-by: Claude Code:claude-opus-5-5
Signed-off-by: Ricardo Salveti <ricardo.salveti@oss.qualcomm.com>

Upstream-Status: Submitted [https://github.com/alsa-project/alsa-ucm-conf/pull/901]
---
 ucm2/Qualcomm/qcs8300/arduino-monza/HiFi.conf | 10 ++++------
 1 file changed, 4 insertions(+), 6 deletions(-)

diff --git a/ucm2/Qualcomm/qcs8300/arduino-monza/HiFi.conf b/ucm2/Qualcomm/qcs8300/arduino-monza/HiFi.conf
index 5d2ac0f..55eeb22 100644
--- a/ucm2/Qualcomm/qcs8300/arduino-monza/HiFi.conf
+++ b/ucm2/Qualcomm/qcs8300/arduino-monza/HiFi.conf
@@ -115,20 +115,18 @@ SectionDevice."Headset" {
 	EnableSequence [
 		cset "name='MIC1 Mux' IN12"
 		cset "name='DMIC Mux' 0"
-		cset "name='Headset Mic Switch' on"
 		cset "name='Headset Mic12 Switch' on"
 		cset "name='Record Path DC Blocking' on"
-		cset "name='Left ADC Mixer MIC2 Switch' on"
-		cset "name='Right ADC Mixer MIC2 Switch' on"
+		cset "name='Left ADC Mixer MIC1 Switch' on"
+		cset "name='Right ADC Mixer MIC1 Switch' on"
 	]
 
 	DisableSequence [
-		cset "name='Headset Mic Switch' off"
 		cset "name='DMIC Mux' 1"
 		cset "name='Record Path DC Blocking' off"
 		cset "name='Headset Mic12 Switch' off"
-		cset "name='Left ADC Mixer MIC2 Switch' off"
-		cset "name='Right ADC Mixer MIC2 Switch' off"
+		cset "name='Left ADC Mixer MIC1 Switch' off"
+		cset "name='Right ADC Mixer MIC1 Switch' off"
 	]
 
 	Value {
